<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS10" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ NoLan: Mitigating Object Hallucinations in Large Vision-Language Models via Dynamic Suppression of Language Priors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.10 </span>Ethics and reproducibility statements</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS11" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ NoLan: Mitigating Object Hallucinations in Large Vision-Language Models via Dynamic Suppression of Language Priors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11 </span>More case studies</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
